Subject: [PATCH] Settings: install the LineageParts used by native preferences

Native gestures.xml inflates a LineagePartsPreference and needs the
touchscreen_gesture_settings entry in the installed LineageParts catalog.
Keep the native destination and install its dependency instead of hiding
the exception or adding a replacement preference implementation.

diff --git a/Android.bp b/Android.bp
--- a/Android.bp
+++ b/Android.bp
@@ -126,6 +126,7 @@ android_app {
     system_ext_specific: true,
     privileged: true,
     required: [
+        "LineageParts",
         "privapp_whitelist_com.android.settings",
         "settings-platform-compat-config",
     ],
